  Slug: school-of-thassilonian-rune-magic
  DisplayName: School of Thassilonian Rune Magic
  IconPath: icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-rough-white-teal.webp
  Description: 'This curriculum, taught at a few select academies in New Thassilon,
    can be learned only by wizards with the runelord class archetype. You have begun
    to study one of the seven runes of sin, granting you great power but at the cost
    of anathematic magic. All runelords gain the below curriculum and school spells.
    In addition, you must choose one of the seven sins to specialize in. You add
    your sin''s spells and initial school spells to your curriculum. The addictive
    nature of sin magic prevents you from using magic in ways aligned with other
    sins, represented by that sin''s anathema. Casting a sin spell never invokes
    the anathema of its school of sin. Unlike other wizards, some of your curriculum
    spells may be spells that don''t typically appear on the arcane spell list (marked
    with an asterisk). You still cast these spells as arcane spells, the unifying
    knowledge of sin bridging the gap between disparate magics. Curriculum cantrips:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Detect Magic], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sigil]
    1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mystic Armor], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Runic
    Body], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Runic Weapon], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sure
    Strike] 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Darkvision], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.See
    the Unseen] 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Clairaudience], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Veil
    of Privacy] 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Clairvoyance], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fly]
    5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mind Probe], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sending]
    6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Scrying], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truesight]
    7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Contingency], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spell
    Riposte] 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unrelenting Observation],
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hidden Mind] 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Foresight]
    Advanced School Spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Personal Runewell]
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Envy] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Gluttony]
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Greed] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Lust]
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Pride] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Sloth]
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Wrath]'
